{"seq":3,"slug":"bank-account-signatory-structure","title":"银行账户体系与签约行/签字权管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/intercompany-funding-transfer/bank-account-signatory-structure","wordCount":2440,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"银行账户体系与签约行-签字权管理\">银行账户体系与签约行/签字权管理</h1><p>资金池的所有机制最终都落在账户上。一个跨境集团往往有数百甚至上千个银行账户，分布在不同法域、不同银行、不同币种，每个账户背后有一套签约文件、一组签字权、一段开户流程。这些账户不被管好的后果是具体的：一个离职员工的签字权没注销，一笔资金在无人看管的休眠账户里躺了两年，一次开户延误导致资金池备案通知书失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>账户治理要同时管三件事：<strong>账户本身</strong>（在哪家银行、什么币种、什么用途）、<strong>签约关系</strong>（集团与银行的协议体系）、<strong>授权关系</strong>（谁有权操作这个账户）。三者分离管理，因为它们的变更频率与责任主体不同：账户变更随业务调整，签约关系变更随银行谈判，授权变更随人员流动——而人员流动是最频繁也最容易失控的一项。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[集团资金政策] --&gt; B[银行关系]&#10;    A --&gt; C[账户结构]&#10;    A --&gt; D[授权体系]&#10;    B --&gt; E[主签约行 / 区域行]&#10;    B --&gt; F[服务协议与费率]&#10;    C --&gt; G[资金池主账户]&#10;    C --&gt; H[成员操作账户]&#10;    C --&gt; I[收付专用账户]&#10;    D --&gt; J[签字权层级]&#10;    D --&gt; K[授权额度矩阵]&#10;    D --&gt; L[电子银行权限]&#10;    H --&gt; M[日终归集至 主账户]&#10;    I --&gt; M\">graph TD\n    A[集团资金政策] --&gt; B[银行关系]\n    A --&gt; C[账户结构]\n    A --&gt; D[授权体系]\n    B --&gt; E[主签约行 / 区域行]\n    B --&gt; F[服务协议与费率]\n    C --&gt; G[资金池主账户]\n    C --&gt; H[成员操作账户]\n    C --&gt; I[收付专用账户]\n    D --&gt; J[签字权层级]\n    D --&gt; K[授权额度矩阵]\n    D --&gt; L[电子银行权限]\n    H --&gt; M[日终归集至 主账户]\n    I --&gt; M</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>治理对象</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n<th>控制手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>账户结构</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>账户冗余、休眠账户</td>\n<td>年度账户清查与销户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>银行关系</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>依赖单一银行、费率失控</td>\n<td>多行策略与定期比价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签字权</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>离职未注销、越权支付</td>\n<td>与人事流程绑定、定期复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电子银行权限</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>权限过大、共享凭据</td>\n<td>按角色授权、双人复核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"银行关系-签约行策略\">银行关系：签约行策略</h2><h3 id=\"主签约行与区域行\">主签约行与区域行</h3><p>集团通常选择一到两家<strong>主签约行</strong>（relationship bank）提供资金池、现金管理、贸易融资等核心服务，再在各区域选择<strong>区域行</strong>（regional bank）处理本地收付。这样做的理由是：主签约行能提供跨境的统一产品与账户视图，但本地收付的效率与成本往往不如当地银行；纯本地银行虽便宜，却无法支撑跨境归集。</p>\n<p>选择签约行时分量的维度不只有价格：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>产品覆盖</td>\n<td>是否支持资金池、跨境归集、名义池、多币种账户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络覆盖</td>\n<td>目标法域的分行或代理行网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术与报文</td>\n<td>是否支持 ISO 20022 报文、API 对接、实时余额查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授信能力</td>\n<td>是否愿意提供透支额度与备用信贷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规能力</td>\n<td>反洗钱与制裁筛查的能力与响应速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定性</td>\n<td>信用评级、所在法域监管环境</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>支付指令与状态回传依赖的报文标准（pain.001、pacs.008、pain.002、camt.053 等）是银行技术能力的基本门槛，见<a href=\"../cash-pool-structure/inhouse-bank-payment-factory\">内部银行与收付款工厂</a>。一家不支持这些报文的银行，会让收付款工厂的自动化程度大幅下降。</p>\n<h3 id=\"反洗钱与制裁筛查的银行侧义务\">反洗钱与制裁筛查的银行侧义务</h3><p>合作关系受合规审查约束。银行执行&quot;了解客户、了解业务、尽职审查&quot;原则，发现异常须及时报告；跨境资金池规则还要求合作银行近两年外汇业务合规与审慎经营评估达到 <strong>B 类（含）以上</strong>，近两年无重大违法违规，反洗钱内控完善且履职无重大缺陷（见<a href=\"../cash-pool-structure/crossborder-pool-fx-regulatory\">跨境归集的外汇/资本项目监管约束</a>）。这些条件不是一次性的准入检查——银行不再符合条件时只能办理存量已备案业务，不得新增业务类别或新增资金池客户。</p>\n<p>集团侧的对应义务是付款信息完整。金融行动特别工作组关于电汇的建议要求跨境电汇附带汇款人与收款人信息，缺失会导致银行拒付或人工审查。工程上这意味着收付款系统必须在报文中携带完整的主体信息，而不是为了&quot;简化&quot;而省略字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"账户结构设计\">账户结构设计</h2><h3 id=\"账户的最小化原则\">账户的最小化原则</h3><p>账户数量的默认方向应该是<strong>减少而非增加</strong>。每多一个账户，就多一份签约、一套授权、一次月末对账、一个潜在的休眠风险。设计时的判据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>是否有独立账户的必要</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>必须独立</td>\n<td>该法域法规要求本地账户；该币种需本地清算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可以合并</td>\n<td>同一法域同一币种、用途相同、由同一主体操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应当关闭</td>\n<td>无交易活动超过一个周期；用途已终止</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>主账户与操作账户的分工在<a href=\"../cash-pool-structure/physical-vs-notional-pooling\">实体归集 vs 名义资金池</a>中已讨论：主账户是对外可见的资金归集点，操作账户是收支通道。跨境场景下另有专用于境外成员的 NRA 账户。</p>\n<h3 id=\"账户数据的结构与主数据\">账户数据的结构与主数据</h3><p>账户信息必须作为主数据管理，而不是散落在各业务系统的配置里。账户的完整属性包括：账户标识、银行、币种、所属法人、账户类型、用途、签约依据、授权组、状态、开立与关闭日期。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;accountId&quot;: &quot;ACC-NL-0001&quot;,&#10;  &quot;iban&quot;: &quot;NL91XXXX0000000001&quot;,&#10;  &quot;bank&quot;: { &quot;bic&quot;: &quot;XXXXNL2A&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Pool Bank NL&quot;, &quot;role&quot;: &quot;primary&quot; },&#10;  &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;EUR&quot;,&#10;  &quot;legalEntity&quot;: &quot;NL-OPCO&quot;,&#10;  &quot;accountType&quot;: &quot;operation&quot;,&#10;  &quot;purpose&quot;: &quot;collections_and_payments&quot;,&#10;  &quot;pool&quot;: { &quot;poolId&quot;: &quot;EU-MAIN-01&quot;, &quot;role&quot;: &quot;participant&quot;, &quot;sweep&quot;: &quot;zero_balance&quot; },&#10;  &quot;signatories&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;role&quot;: &quot;primary&quot;, &quot;groupId&quot;: &quot;SIG-A&quot;, &quot;limit&quot;: 5000000, &quot;count&quot;: 2 },&#10;    { &quot;role&quot;: &quot;backup&quot;, &quot;groupId&quot;: &quot;SIG-B&quot;, &quot;limit&quot;: 500000, &quot;count&quot;: 2 }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;ebanking&quot;: { &quot;profile&quot;: &quot;OPS-RW&quot;, &quot;dualApproval&quot;: true },&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;active&quot;,&#10;  &quot;openedAt&quot;: &quot;2024-03-12&quot;,&#10;  &quot;reviewDue&quot;: &quot;2027-03-12&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"accountId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ACC-NL-0001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"iban\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NL91XXXX0000000001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"bank\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"bic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"XXXXNL2A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Pool Bank NL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"legalEntity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NL-OPCO\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"accountType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"operation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"purpose\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"collections_and_payments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"poolId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EU-MAIN-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"participant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sweep\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"zero_balance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"signatories\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"groupId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SIG-A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"limit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"backup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"groupId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SIG-B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"limit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ebanking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"profile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OPS-RW\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"dualApproval\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"active\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"openedAt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2024-03-12\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reviewDue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-03-12\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份结构的关键点是把<strong>签字权与限额绑定在账户上</strong>（<code>signatories</code>），而不是绑定在人上。人的岗位会变，账户的授权要求相对稳定——用&quot;授权组&quot;作为中间层，人员入组出组即可，避免为每个账户逐个调整人名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"签字权与授权管理\">签字权与授权管理</h2><h3 id=\"分级授权与双人复核\">分级授权与双人复核</h3><p>授权体系通常分三级：<strong>操作级</strong>（提交支付指令）、<strong>审批级</strong>（批准一定额度内的支付）、<strong>授权级</strong>（批准超额支付与账户变更）。设置的核心是额度矩阵与人数要求：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>支付生效</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>approvers</mtext></mrow><mtext>limit</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>≥</mo><mtext>amount</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∧</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>count</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{支付生效} \\iff \\left( \\sum*{i \\in \\text{approvers}} \\text{limit}\\_i \\geq \\text{amount} \\right) \\wedge (\\text{count} \\geq n*{\\min})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">支付生效</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">approvers</span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">limit</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">amount</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">count</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也即：审批人的限额之和覆盖金额，且审批人数不少于下限。这一&quot;额度之和&quot;的设计优于&quot;单笔限额&quot;设计——它允许小额支付单人审批、大额支付需要多人，而不必为每种金额设一个层级。</p>\n<h3 id=\"电子银行权限与安全程序\">电子银行权限与安全程序</h3><p>电子银行的权限设计要与纸质签字权一致，否则会出现&quot;系统里能付、纸上没授权&quot;的缺口。银行与客户之间关于支付指令认证的约定有明确的法律框架：若双方约定以<strong>安全程序</strong>验证支付指令，该程序在商业上合理且银行善意遵守，则即使指令<strong>未经授权</strong>也可作为客户的有效指令；商业合理性是<strong>法律问题</strong>，法院会考虑客户的明示意愿、银行知悉的情况（指令的金额、类型、频率）、银行提供的替代程序以及同类客户常用做法（见 <a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/ucc/4A/4A-202\">UCC § 4A-202</a>）。</p>\n<p>对集团的直接启示是三条可执行的做法：安全程序必须与账户的支付规模相匹配（大额账户不能只用简单口令）；与银行的授权文件必须书面且明确；当集团拒绝银行提供的更强安全方案时，必须留下书面确认。这三条在事后争议里决定责任归属。</p>\n<h3 id=\"人员变动与授权回收\">人员变动与授权回收</h3><p>授权回收是账户治理中最容易失效的环节。可执行的机制是把授权复核挂到人事流程上：入职、转岗、离职事件触发账户授权的增删，且该动作有明确的完成时限与责任人。定期（通常按季或半年）做全量授权复核，核对在职人员与账户授权名单的一致性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;  a.account_id,&#10;  a.legal_entity,&#10;  s.group_id,&#10;  s.limit_amount,&#10;  COUNT(e.employee_id)                        AS active_holders,&#10;  SUM(CASE WHEN e.status &lt;&gt; &#39;active&#39; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS stale_holders,&#10;  MAX(s.last_reviewed)                        AS last_reviewed&#10;FROM account_signatory s&#10;JOIN account a ON a.account_id = s.account_id&#10;LEFT JOIN employee_authorization e&#10;       ON e.group_id = s.group_id&#10;      AND e.legal_entity = a.legal_entity&#10;WHERE a.status = &#39;active&#39;&#10;GROUP BY a.account_id, a.legal_entity, s.group_id, s.limit_amount&#10;HAVING SUM(CASE WHEN e.status &lt;&gt; &#39;active&#39; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) &gt; 0&#10;    OR MAX(s.last_reviewed) &lt; CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;180 days&#39;&#10;ORDER BY stale_holders DESC, last_reviewed ASC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">legal_entity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">group_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">limit_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">employee_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> active_holders,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stale_holders,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">last_reviewed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_reviewed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_signatory s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee_authorization e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">group_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">group_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">legal_entity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">legal_entity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">legal_entity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">group_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">limit_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">last_reviewed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'180 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stale_holders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, last_reviewed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>stale_holders</code> 指出授权组里还挂着非在职人员的账户，<code>last_reviewed</code> 超过半年的账户进入复核队列。这条查询把&quot;授权回收&quot;从制度要求变成了可运行的巡检。</p>\n<h2 id=\"账户开立-变更与关闭的流程控制\">账户开立、变更与关闭的流程控制</h2><p>账户的生命周期管理与资金池的监管时限直接耦合。跨境资金池备案通知书出具后须<strong>一年内</strong>开立国内资金主账户并实际开展业务，逾期失效；合作银行、主办企业、业务种类、额度变更须在<strong>30 日内</strong>申请变更备案（见<a href=\"../cash-pool-structure/crossborder-pool-fx-regulatory\">跨境归集的外汇/资本项目监管约束</a>）。这些时限必须内建到开户流程里，作为流程的硬约束而非事后提醒。</p>\n<p>关闭账户前的检查同样重要：确认无未结清余额、无未到期的自动扣划协议、无关联的担保或质押安排、无未完成的监管报告义务。休眠账户应设置识别规则（连续若干周期无交易且余额低于阈值）并进入销户流程，而不是任其累积。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>账户治理分三层：账户本身、签约关系、授权关系；授权变更频率最高、最易失控。</li>\n<li>签约行策略权衡产品覆盖、网络、报文能力、授信、合规与稳定性，价格不是唯一维度。</li>\n<li>银行合规审查是持续的：评估降级会限制新增业务；集团侧须保证付款报文信息完整。</li>\n<li>账户数量默认应减少；主数据化后签字权绑定在&quot;授权组&quot;而非具体人上。</li>\n<li>授权采用额度矩阵加人数下限，优于按金额逐级设限。</li>\n<li>电子银行权限须与纸质签字权一致；安全程序的商业合理性、书面约定、拒绝更安全方案的书面确认是事后责任分配的关键。</li>\n<li>授权回收须与人事流程绑定并定期全量复核；开户与变更时限须内建到流程中。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"银行账户体系与签约行/签字权管理","id":"银行账户体系与签约行-签字权管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"银行关系：签约行策略","id":"银行关系-签约行策略"},{"level":3,"text":"主签约行与区域行","id":"主签约行与区域行"},{"level":3,"text":"反洗钱与制裁筛查的银行侧义务","id":"反洗钱与制裁筛查的银行侧义务"},{"level":2,"text":"账户结构设计","id":"账户结构设计"},{"level":3,"text":"账户的最小化原则","id":"账户的最小化原则"},{"level":3,"text":"账户数据的结构与主数据","id":"账户数据的结构与主数据"},{"level":2,"text":"签字权与授权管理","id":"签字权与授权管理"},{"level":3,"text":"分级授权与双人复核","id":"分级授权与双人复核"},{"level":3,"text":"电子银行权限与安全程序","id":"电子银行权限与安全程序"},{"level":3,"text":"人员变动与授权回收","id":"人员变动与授权回收"},{"level":2,"text":"账户开立、变更与关闭的流程控制","id":"账户开立-变更与关闭的流程控制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内部资金转移定价（FTP）与利息","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/intercompany-funding-transfer/fund-transfer-pricing-interest"},"next":{"title":"资金头寸外汇敞口与对冲策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/treasury-risk-metric/fx-exposure-hedge-policy"}}